	FMNORMALIZEGRAPHICS 
	[/fy /fx /fh /fw /ury /urx /lly /llx] {exch def} forall 
	fx fw 2 div add fy fh 2 div add  translate
	rotate
	fw 2 div neg fh 2 div neg translate
	fw urx llx sub div fh ury lly sub div scale 
